][<SPT><TTL><SUB>Item A5047</SUB> Cabinet, Medicine</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Medicine cabinet constructed of heavy gauge stainless steel and have a mirror mounted in swinging door, a minimum 
