][<SPT><TTL><SUB>Item A5084</SUB> Dryer, Hands Free, Forced Air, Automatic</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Surface mounted high speed automatic hand dryer. Unit made of stainless steel with satin finish.  Electronic 
